I'm freaking screwed.

9
00:01:28,450 --> 00:01:30,450
Yeo Eunho, why did you lock the door?

10
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:32,380
Don't come in, you prick!

11
00:01:33,729 --> 00:01:35,940
Did you think I'd pounce on you
while you were asleep?

12
00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:37,479
Please leave me alone!

13
00:01:37,729 --> 00:01:39,860
Come out. It's time for school.

14
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:41,710
You go first. Go without me.

15
00:01:41,910 --> 00:01:42,780
Why?

16
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,420
Just do as I say, man!

17
00:01:46,410 --> 00:01:47,600
Don't be late.

18
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:27,040
[Yeo Eunho]

19
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:53,970
[Sung Inho]

20
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:00,550
[Kim Domin]

21
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:23,140
[Summertime]

22
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:28,360
Eunho!

23
00:03:32,230 --> 00:03:34,390
Are you crazy? Why did you touch my butt?

24
00:03:34,390 --> 00:03:36,130
What's wrong? We're both guys.

25
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:37,520
You can touch mine too.

26
00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:38,880
You're gross.

27
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:41,820
Eunho, wait for me.

28
00:03:47,329 --> 00:03:48,670
Damn it.

29
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,280
Yeo Eunho!

30
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:07,200
Why are you sneaking over the gate
instead of using the front entrance?

31
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,460
None of your business.

32
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,180
Need me to catch you?

33
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,320
What did we do?

34
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,240
We haven't even started.

35
00:04:20,779 --> 00:04:21,700
My darling.

36
00:04:22,630 --> 00:04:23,650
No need.

37
00:04:32,590 --> 00:04:34,350
Keep your hands off my stuff.

38
00:04:44,170 --> 00:04:45,870
Why are you so cranky today?

39
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:49,610
Did you not sleep well
because I was in the living room?

40
00:04:49,610 --> 00:04:50,650
Buzz off!

41
00:04:52,610 --> 00:04:55,270
Why so testy?
Woke up on the wrong side of the bed?

42
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,830
Don't talk to me.

43
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:10,340
Damn it.

44
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:13,870
How can they make students
do a deep clean of the school?

45
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:16,270
As a student,
why aren't you studying hard?

46
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:18,560
This is totally a human rights invasion.

47
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:21,040
I'm going to report this
to the Ministry of Education.

48
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:23,210
It's a human rights "violation,"
not "invasion."

49
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:24,190
Idiot.

50
00:05:24,730 --> 00:05:26,030
Just shut up and clean.

51
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:28,010
Studying isn't your strong suit anyway.

52
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:30,320
You and your stupid mouth. Damn you.

53
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:31,440
Freaking hell.

54
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,520
Screw this. I'm done.

55
00:05:34,909 --> 00:05:36,690
You do it all. So annoying.

56
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:39,330
If you're bad at school,

57
00:05:39,330 --> 00:05:42,260
you should at least give your best
with the cleaning.

58
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,520
You give your best.

59
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:06,190
Hey, Kwon Yihyun.

60
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:10,500
Didn't you say you were...

61
00:06:12,820 --> 00:06:16,090
discriminated against at your old school

62
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:17,300
because you were gay?

63
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:18,950
Yeah.

64
00:06:20,570 --> 00:06:23,540
Do you have any close friends?

65
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:25,680
Like, longtime friends.

66
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:32,260
I transferred a lot
because of my parents' work.

67
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,860
So I never had any longtime friends.

68
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,460
But...

69
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:44,320
I had a crush on a friend once.

70
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:54,909
You're curious how it turned out,
aren't you?

71
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:57,070
I'm not.

72
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:04,580
I ran away.

73
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:08,170
Why? Were you scared
it'd ruin your friendship?

74
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:11,930
No.

75
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,600
It was to protect him.

76
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:19,310
You ran away to protect him?

77
00:07:20,890 --> 00:07:21,890
Yeah.

78
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,590
Does he know that?

79
00:07:28,910 --> 00:07:30,130
Probably not.

80
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,570
Did he like you too?

81
00:07:38,210 --> 00:07:41,970
No idea. That's not important.

82
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:44,900
Why not?

83
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,040
Because that's how he feels.

84
00:08:02,090 --> 00:08:03,820
Look into your own heart.

85
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,900
That comes first.

86
00:08:17,380 --> 00:08:20,120
[Cha Dohyun: How'd I know
if you won't tell me why?]

87
00:08:20,250 --> 00:08:22,300
[Cha Dohyun: Why are you so mad at me?]

88
00:08:22,410 --> 00:08:25,310
[Cha Dohyun: You just gonna ignore me?]

89
00:08:25,450 --> 00:08:28,010
[Cha Dohyun: I'll come find you
during recess. Let's talk.]

90
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:37,980
Dude.

91
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,500
If Cha Dohyun comes looking for me,
tell him I'm not here.

92
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,900
You guys fighting again?

93
00:08:44,210 --> 00:08:45,550
Didn't you make up?

94
00:08:46,090 --> 00:08:47,020
I don't know.

95
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:54,830
Yeo Eunho.

96
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,270
Where's Eunho?

97
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,290
Where could Eunho be?

98
00:09:04,290 --> 00:09:06,020
Jaewon, have you seen Eunho?

99
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:08,450
Huh? O-Oh, well, let's see.

100
00:09:08,580 --> 00:09:10,340
Where did Eunho go?

101
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,260
He's so intense.

102
00:09:18,650 --> 00:09:19,810
Yeo Eunho.

103
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:56,960
I'm so stuffed.

104
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:00,200
The sweet and spicy fried chicken
was banging.

105
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:02,640
That was fried semi-dried pollock.

106
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,560
What?

107
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,960
As they say,

108
00:10:06,130 --> 00:10:07,680
your perhaps is your reality.

109
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,300
Your perhaps?

110
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:12,550
It's "your perception
is your reality," idiot.

111
00:10:13,150 --> 00:10:15,360
Eunho! Aren't you hungry?

112
00:10:16,450 --> 00:10:17,670
No.

113
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,800
Aren't you going to change?

114
00:10:22,900 --> 00:10:25,300
Say I'm sick
and went to the nurse's office.

115
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:30,060
Hey, did you forget
your gym clothes again?

116
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:32,300
Don't you have your buddy Cha Dohyun?

117
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:36,060
Oh right, you're avoiding him...

118
00:10:37,050 --> 00:10:38,400
Come here.

119
00:10:40,090 --> 00:10:41,170
Damn it.

120
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:48,990
Here, wear mine.

121
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:58,840
It's better to move your body
when you're frustrated.

122
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,470
What about you?

123
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,500
I'll just borrow from someone else.

124
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:14,850
-Eight people in total...
-Seven.

125
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:23,040
I heard we have PE with Class 2 today.

126
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,720
What are we playing?

127
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:28,430
Are you dumb?
We're at a basketball court.

128
00:11:29,710 --> 00:11:30,620
Pass it to me!

129
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:31,430
Over here.

130
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:32,780
Hurry!

131
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,170
Why are you avoiding me?

132
00:11:38,830 --> 00:11:39,910
Answer me.

133
00:11:40,710 --> 00:11:42,160
So you won't steal the ball.

134
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,560
Did I do something wrong?

135
00:11:43,910 --> 00:11:45,110
I'm not avoiding you.

136
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:47,510
You won't answer my calls
or read my texts.

137
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:49,560
I like you.

138
00:11:53,410 --> 00:11:54,330
Basket!

139
00:12:00,100 --> 00:12:01,110
-Eunho!
-Hey, Eunho!

140
00:12:01,110 --> 00:12:02,420
Screw you, you prick!

141
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:03,870
-What's wrong?
-What's going on?

142
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:04,870
What's with you, Eunho?

143
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:07,740
Don't toy with me, you scumbag.

144
00:12:07,890 --> 00:12:09,290
You disgust me.

145
00:12:13,050 --> 00:12:13,980
What's with him?

146
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:14,870
I don't know.

147
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:28,810
Never thought there'd come a day
when Eunho would suggest ditching class.

148
00:12:30,110 --> 00:12:31,590
It's nice and sunny.

149
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,290
It's on me today.

150
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,760
Okay!

151
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:37,470
Is that even a card you're holding?

152
00:12:37,770 --> 00:12:39,700
Today's the day Gunwoo goes broke!

153
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:43,830
Why did you tag along?

154
00:12:45,210 --> 00:12:46,700
Class is boring anyway.

155
00:12:48,090 --> 00:12:49,820
Come on, time is ticking.

156
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,020
Hurry up.

157
00:13:15,930 --> 00:13:17,070
Wow, not bad.

158
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:22,420
Eunho.

159
00:13:22,890 --> 00:13:24,610
Keep your eyes on the ball, Eunho.

160
00:13:24,610 --> 00:13:25,870
Should we just go home?

161
00:13:25,990 --> 00:13:27,050
You can do it, Eunho.

162
00:13:27,050 --> 00:13:28,510
Keep your eyes on the ball.

163
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:31,000
Eunho, are you serious?

164
00:13:31,130 --> 00:13:32,030
Eunho!

165
00:13:32,180 --> 00:13:33,140
Just stay in school!

166
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:34,600
You've got this this time!

167
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,280
He's hopeless!

168
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:46,230
Don't come closer.

169
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:32,670
He said he likes me.

170
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:45,210
Don't you ever tell him.

171
00:14:49,290 --> 00:14:51,820
Don't ever confess to the friend you like.

172
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:08,980
Ugh, there's school tomorrow.

173
00:15:09,750 --> 00:15:11,910
Hey, the time... What time is it?

174
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:12,890
Seven.

175
00:15:13,530 --> 00:15:15,030
I'm starving.

176
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:16,790
Yeo Eunho.

177
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,660
Why so gloomy?

178
00:15:20,890 --> 00:15:22,040
Want a smoke?

179
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:27,330
Gosh, it's about time you smoke.
You're such a drag.

180
00:15:27,470 --> 00:15:29,610
Smoking will clear your head.

181
00:15:34,070 --> 00:15:35,170
Want one?

182
00:15:39,710 --> 00:15:40,890
Nope.

183
00:15:43,830 --> 00:15:46,800
He's chicken now
after getting chewed out by Cha Dohyun.

184
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,860
You're right.

185
00:15:49,010 --> 00:15:50,790
He sure listens to Cha Dohyun.

186
00:15:50,990 --> 00:15:53,800
I bet if Cha Dohyun told him to die,
he'd play dead.

187
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,670
For sure.

188
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:58,960
You two should just drop dead together.

189
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:15,010
[Yihyun:
So? He still hasn't texted you?]

190
00:16:15,190 --> 00:16:18,020
[Eunho: He's so petty.
I'd die before I text him first.]

191
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:21,220
[Yihyun: How do you truly feel?]

192
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:29,860
[Death anniversary
of Cha Dohyun's parents]

193
00:16:27,690 --> 00:16:28,780
Crap.

194
00:16:45,350 --> 00:16:48,340
[Rice Wine]

195
00:17:35,930 --> 00:17:38,900
[Father: Cha Sungho, Mother: Yoon Hyejin
Dad, Mom, I miss you and love you.]

196
00:18:29,050 --> 00:18:32,170
[Dad, Mom, I miss you and love you.]

197
00:18:33,410 --> 00:18:36,530
Mr. and Mrs. Cha,

198
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:40,210
it's been a while since I visited you.

199
00:18:41,130 --> 00:18:44,840
He has Jihyun, me,

200
00:18:45,780 --> 00:18:48,000
and my parents.

201
00:18:49,340 --> 00:18:51,380
So don't worry too much.

202
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:55,370
Rest in peace on the other side.

203
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:01,970
Should I pour out the rest?

204
00:20:16,570 --> 00:20:17,500
Hey,

205
00:20:18,540 --> 00:20:19,920
take that back.

206
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:21,880
Take what back?

207
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:24,600
The part where I said I like you?

208
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:32,010
Come on.

209
00:20:32,310 --> 00:20:33,910
You weren't serious anyway.

210
00:20:35,580 --> 00:20:36,960
I'm a mess because of you.

211
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,150
You've taken this joke too far.

212
00:20:38,150 --> 00:20:39,170
Yeo Eunho,

213
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:43,660
will it make you feel better
to pretend everything I do

214
00:20:44,140 --> 00:20:45,910
is just a joke?

215
00:20:48,670 --> 00:20:49,920
You frivolous jerk.

216
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:01,000
Seeing as it's all a joke, you won't mind
what I'm about to do next, right?

217
00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:07,350
Are you sure you can handle it

218
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,690
if I'm totally honest with you?

219
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:15,780
We've known each other for 19 years.
19 freaking years.

220
00:21:16,750 --> 00:21:20,480
Do you think it makes sense
for us... to be a thing?

221
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:24,350
It's all your fault.

222
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:27,560
Because of you,
we can't go back to how we were.

223
00:21:29,310 --> 00:21:31,910
Can you really
cut ties with my family for good?

224
00:21:33,950 --> 00:21:35,250
For the rest of your life?

225
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:37,120
Can you? Answer me!

226
00:21:39,140 --> 00:21:42,660
If you can't go through with it,
why did you provoke me?

227
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:46,100
If you'd just kept it to yourself,

228
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,620
this shitshow wouldn't be happening.

229
00:21:47,620 --> 00:21:49,360
Can't go through with it?

230
00:21:50,690 --> 00:21:51,960
Yeo Eunho,

231
00:21:52,390 --> 00:21:55,250
I'm prepared to lose you as a friend.

232
00:21:55,750 --> 00:21:59,080
As we got older, did you think
I still only saw you as a friend?

233
00:22:00,050 --> 00:22:01,810
You selfish jerk.

234
00:22:02,390 --> 00:22:04,840
How can you say that?

235
00:22:05,260 --> 00:22:08,120
Does our 19 years of friendship
mean nothing to you?

236
00:22:10,390 --> 00:22:12,720
You knew how I've felt about you.

237
00:22:13,060 --> 00:22:14,280
Didn't you?

238
00:22:15,020 --> 00:22:17,820
I know you weren't asleep
in the classroom that day.

239
00:22:17,820 --> 00:22:20,950
You play dumb
just to make yourself feel better,

240
00:22:21,070 --> 00:22:22,620
and now you're blaming me?

241
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:24,580
Am I the only selfish one here?

242
00:22:26,140 --> 00:22:27,220
Yeo Eunho,

243
00:22:27,890 --> 00:22:30,460
I can no longer be just friends with you.

244
00:22:30,950 --> 00:22:32,270
If you knew

245
00:22:32,530 --> 00:22:35,590
how many times
I've imagined devouring you alive,

246
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:38,860
I doubt you'd think
we should stay friends either.

247
00:22:52,320 --> 00:22:53,530
Family?

248
00:22:54,630 --> 00:22:56,420
Bullshit.

249
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:05,080
What kind of bastard
gets turned on by his own brother?

250
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:34,330
[Summertime]

251
00:23:34,430 --> 00:23:35,480
Yeo Eunho,

252
00:23:35,820 --> 00:23:36,850
is something up?

253
00:23:37,220 --> 00:23:39,020
You've been spacing out all day.

254
00:23:40,020 --> 00:23:42,030
Because he has someone he likes.

255
00:23:43,180 --> 00:23:46,510
Yeo Eunho, give me a straight answer.

256
00:23:46,730 --> 00:23:49,040
If you don't like me, just say it.

257
00:23:49,560 --> 00:23:51,360
Whether it's taekwondo or studying,

258
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:53,450
nothing's been easy.

259
00:23:54,620 --> 00:23:56,160
But Yeo Eunho, you are...

260
00:23:57,520 --> 00:23:59,250
especially hard to figure out.

261
00:23:59,430 --> 00:24:01,470
If I didn't push you,

262
00:24:01,900 --> 00:24:04,870
would you have made an effort
to understand my feelings?

263
00:24:04,870 --> 00:24:07,130
You knew how I've felt about you.

264
00:24:07,660 --> 00:24:08,820
Didn't you?

265
00:24:09,250 --> 00:24:11,000
You don't drink anyway.

266
00:24:11,300 --> 00:24:12,190
I do.

267
00:24:12,330 --> 00:24:13,450
Since when?

268
00:24:13,700 --> 00:24:14,850
Since now.

269
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:17,140
Why aren't you mingling?

270
00:24:20,750 --> 00:24:23,120
It doesn't take much to break someone.

271
00:24:24,770 --> 00:24:26,500
Yeo Eunho got into an accident.

272
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:28,000
I saw him in the nurse's office.

273
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,330
